 **Formulas:**
 - **Impostor Position ($P_{imp}$):**
-  $$ P_{imp} = C + R \cdot \frac{C - V}{\|C - V\|} $$
+  $$ P_{imp} = C - R \cdot \frac{C - V}{\|C - V\|} $$
   Where:
   - $C$ is the sphere center.
   - $V$ is the camera position.
   - $R$ is the sphere radius.
-  - $\| \cdot \|$ denotes the Euclidean norm.
+  - $\| \cdot \|$ denotes the Euclidean norm. [S1, unofficial]
 
